version: 1.6.2
date-released: 2026-08-19
url: "https://github.com/kaposty/context-kit"
repository-code: "https://github.com/kaposty/context-kit"
license: MIT
abstract: "A context kit for Claude Code. A session ledger carries the reasoning of a session across the compaction that would otherwise keep what happened and lose why; a manual checkpoint pass brings every durable store current before the summary is taken; a guardrail refuses a compaction from an unprepared state. Silent by construction, and project neutral."
keywords:
